# Only a leading and a trailing run of elements can leave a node's span:
# the span is one range of the source.
# error: span_mark_middle.grammar:18:15:
# error: span mark on '-","': only leading and trailing elements can be left out of a node's span
@lexer
tokens
    ident
    semi
    comma
    eof
    err
';'                                         → semi
','                                         → comma
[a-z]+                                      → ident
.                                           → err

@parser
top! = IDENT -"," IDENT ";"                 → (top 1 3)
